title: The District Question
new-page: true
view-if: crisis = 0 and organisers_timer <= 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.organisers_timer = 3;
Q.month_actions += 1;
// target the least loyal district
var target = Q.districts[0];
for (var d of Q.districts) {
    if (Q['district_' + d + '_loyalty'] < Q['district_' + target + '_loyalty']) {
        target = d;
    }
}
Q.target_district = target;
Q.target_district_name = Q.district_names[target];
Q.target_faction = Q['district_' + target + '_faction'];
Q.target_faction_name = Q.faction_names[Q.target_faction];
Q.target_is_rival = Q.target_faction != Q.leading_faction ? 1 : 0;
!}
frequency: 300
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs

= The District Question

The district of **[+ target_district_name +]**, which follows the [+ target_faction_name +], is the least loyal to the Zentrale. Its secretary answers letters late or not at all, and its paper prints what it likes.

Holding the Zentrale means little if the districts ignore it.

- @send: Send organisers from the Zentrale.
- @autonomy: Promise the district its autonomy.
- @replace: Remove the district leadership.
- @easy_discard

@send
subtitle: Costs 1 fund. The district moves closer to the Zentrale; a devoted district may change sides.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We have no funds.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
var d = Q.target_district;
Q['district_' + d + '_loyalty'] += 20;
Q.target_flipped = 0;
if (Q['district_' + d + '_loyalty'] >= 80 && Q['district_' + d + '_faction'] != Q.leading_faction) {
    Q['district_' + d + '_faction'] = Q.leading_faction;
    Q['district_' + d + '_loyalty'] = 60;
    Q.target_flipped = 1;
}
Q['lean_' + Q.leading_faction] += 1;
!}

Organisers from the Zentrale speak at every meeting in [+ target_district_name +]. [? if target_flipped : The district has come over to the [+ leading_faction_name +]. ?]

@autonomy
subtitle: The district's current is pleased, and the party is calmer. The Zentrale's authority suffers.
on-arrival: {!
var d = Q.target_district;
Q[Q.target_faction + '_satisfaction'] += 8;
Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 3;
Q['district_' + d + '_loyalty'] += 4;
Q.unity += 3;
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 1;
!}

The Zentrale writes that the district knows its own conditions best. In [+ target_district_name +] they read it as an apology, and accept it.

@replace
subtitle: The district joins our current, but loses members, and its current is outraged.
choose-if: target_is_rival = 1
unavailable-subtitle: The district already follows our current.
on-arrival: {!
var d = Q.target_district;
Q['district_' + d + '_faction'] = Q.leading_faction;
Q['district_' + d + '_loyalty'] = 60;
Q['district_' + d + '_members'] *= 0.6;
Q[Q.target_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 20;
Q.unity -= 10;
Q['lean_' + Q.leading_faction] += 2;
!}

The district leadership is removed and replaced with people loyal to the Zentrale. Many members follow their old leaders out of the party.
